/T (LEARNING PROCESS Our intake process has proven highly efficient for collecting game elements from the field. Earlier in the season, we experimented with a claw pass-through mechanism to mitigate inconsistencies; however, we encountered challenges with alignment precision and cycle speed optimization. Consequently, we reverted to a dropdown active intake with a locking alignment system that reliably transfers elements to our end effector, ensuring faster cycle times overall.)
/E (LEARNING PROCESS Our intake process has proven highly efficient for collecting game elements from the field. Earlier in the season, we experimented with a claw pass-through mechanism to mitigate inconsistencies; however, we encountered challenges with alignment precision and cycle speed optimization. Consequently, we reverted to a dropdown active intake with a locking alignment system that reliably transfers elements to our end effector, ensuring faster cycle times overall.)
/Pg 19 0 R
