/T (The original design of the arm of the robot had 3 degrees of freedom, but the pivot and wrist joints were powered using a belted bevel gear differential driven by two servos mounted in the arm. This design was chosen initially because it would allow for 2 servos worth of power in each joint due to the differential, but during prototyping, the added complexity caused major backlash issues, which prevented accurate control.)
